Data licence

The data in this folder (raw accelerometer recordings, span measurements, session
notes and result tables) are released under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0
International licence (CC BY 4.0).

You may share and adapt the data for any purpose, including commercially, if you
give appropriate credit (Rydvanali, Bangkok Footbridge Vibration Study, 2026),
link to the licence, and indicate if changes were made.

